    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "description": "Ahri is a champion whose playstyle revolves around Recalling, and she has great synergy with many Powers and items.\n\nAhri interacts extremely well with Summoning and Recalling. Her Power allows her to retain permanently granted stats and keywords when Recalled, while also reducing her cost. Therefore, having [p:P0327|Titanic Wake] or [p:P0908|Evolution] is incredibly good for her.\n\nFurthermore, building your Relics around this strength with [r:R0113|Secret Tome] or [r:R0015|Lost Chapter] will provide you with the mana needed to cast spells. [r:R0062|Found Fortune] is used to draw low-cost cards equipped with extra items.\n\nAhri's combo pattern goes like this: Play Ahri -> trigger Relic effects -> Recall her -> Play her again.\n\nThis playstyle becomes much more optimal if you have cost-reduction items for Ahri, such as [i:I0118|Power Riff], or [i:I0015|Spirit Stone] to create copies for the combo. [i:I0210|Blue Buff], [i:I0211|Infinity Edge], or [i:I0078|Philosopher's Stone] also synergize very well with this champion.",
        "descriptionRaw": "Ahri is a champion whose playstyle revolves around Recalling, and she has great synergy with many Powers and items.\\n\\nAhri interacts extremely well with Summoning and Recalling. Her Power allows her to retain permanently granted stats and keywords when Recalled, while also reducing her cost. Therefore, having Titanic Wake or Evolution is incredibly good for her.\\n\\nFurthermore, building your Relics around this strength with Secret Tome or Lost Chapter will provide you with the mana needed to cast spells. Found Fortune is used to draw low-cost cards equipped with extra items.\\n\\nAhri's combo pattern goes like this: Play Ahri -> trigger Relic effects -> Recall her -> Play her again.\\n\\nThis playstyle becomes much more optimal if you have cost-reduction items for Ahri, such as Power Riff, or Spirit Stone to create copies for the combo. Blue Buff, Infinity Edge, or Philosopher's Stone also synergize very well with this champion.",
        "name": "Ahri",
        "optimalStars": "3 Stars",
        "playStyle": "Combo // Recall",
        "regions": [
          "Ionia"
        ],
        "tags": [
          "Solo carry",
          "Recall play style",
          "FTK",
          "Nexus strike",
          "Combo"
        ],
        "tier": "A+ // Glass cannon"
      }
    },
