    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "description": "[c:C006|Spirit Fox Ahri] stands out with a playstyle that revolves around her Ephemeral units, the [cd:98SB007|Fox-Fires].\n\nYou can summon a massive swarm of [cd:98SB007|Fox-Fires] by casting spells that cost 1 or more mana, with their stats scaling based on the cost of the spell used.\n\n[cd:98SB020|Spirit Fox Ahri] excels at closing out games quickly when combined with Relics that boost raw stats and grant [k:SpellOverwhelm|Overwhelm], such as [r:R0080|The Beast Within], [r:R0091|Stone Monkey Strength], [r:R0079|Spirit of the Buhru], and [r:R0116|Packed Deck].\n\n[cd:98SB020|Spirit Fox Ahri] also features a powerful Constellation upgrade to support this exact playstyle: [p:P0857|Spirit Armor]. When comboed with the [r:R0091|Stone Monkey Strength] relic or the [p:P0891|Spirit's Secret] Power, your Ephemeral units will get their stats doubled from all sources.",
        "descriptionRaw": "Spirit Fox Ahri stands out with a playstyle that revolves around her Ephemeral units, the Fox-Fires.\\n\\nYou can summon a massive swarm of Fox-Fires by casting spells that cost 1 or more mana, with their stats scaling based on the cost of the spell used.\\n\\nSpirit Fox Ahri excels at closing out games quickly when combined with Relics that boost raw stats and grant Overwhelm, such as The Beast Within, Stone Monkey Strength, Spirit of the Buhru, and Packed Deck.\\n\\nSpirit Fox Ahri also features a powerful Constellation upgrade to support this exact playstyle: Spirit Armor. When comboed with the Stone Monkey Strength relic or the Spirit's Secret Power, your Ephemeral units will get their stats doubled from all sources.",
        "name": "Spirit Blossom Ahri",
        "optimalStars": "4 Star + Rune star",
        "playStyle": "Midrange / Ephemeral",
