        "recommendedStars": 6,
        "title": "Bộ 1",
        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "description": "Exceptional synergy setup for Hecarim. [r:R0183|Hecarim's Glaive] provides +1 starting mana and automatically summons [cd:01SI021|Shark Chariot] at game start. [r:R0060|Disciple of Shadows] discounts Hecarim, enabling you to drop him onto the board as early as round 1 or round 2. [r:R0080|The Beast Within] grants [k:Overwhelm|Overwhelm] to all allies to trample straight into the enemy Nexus.",
            "descriptionRaw": "Exceptional synergy setup for Hecarim. Hecarim's Glaive provides +1 starting mana and automatically summons Shark Chariot at game start. Disciple of Shadows discounts Hecarim, enabling you to drop him onto the board as early as round 1 or round 2. The Beast Within grants Overwhelm to all allies to trample straight into the enemy Nexus.",
