        "recommendedStars": 4,
        "title": "Bộ 2",
        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "description": "A balanced setup blending removal and lethal pressure. [r:R0048|Chemtech Duplicator] and [r:R0046|Arcane Comet] guarantee control over the midgame, while [r:R0080|The Beast Within] grants [k:Overwhelm|Overwhelm] to your entire Tech army to crash through enemy blockers.",
            "descriptionRaw": "A balanced setup blending removal and lethal pressure. Chemtech Duplicator and Arcane Comet guarantee control over the midgame, while The Beast Within grants Overwhelm to your entire Tech army to crash through enemy blockers.",
