        "title": "Bộ 4",
        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "description": "An innovative swarm strategy leveraging [cd:01PZ056T4|Mk1: Wrenchbot] turrets produced by 1-cost spells. [r:R0079|Spirit of the Buhru] grants Overwhelm, Quick Attack, and Fury to all 1-cost turrets, while [r:R0118|Defense Spending] and [r:R0048|Chemtech Duplicator] turbocharge the swarm.",
            "descriptionRaw": "An innovative swarm strategy leveraging Mk1: Wrenchbot turrets produced by 1-cost spells. Spirit of the Buhru grants Overwhelm, Quick Attack, and Fury to all 1-cost turrets, while Defense Spending and Chemtech Duplicator turbocharge the swarm.",
            "title": "Set 4"
