        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "description": "Similar to Build 5, [r:R0060|Disciple of Shadows] allows you to drop him early, while [r:R0079|Spirit of the Buhru] grants your units [k:SpellOverwhelm|Overwhelm], [k:QuickStrike|Quick Attack], and [k:Fury|Fury].\nWith [r:R0161|Strength of Innovation], you can cast 6+ cost spells right at the start of the round before doing anything else. This allows you to scale up your stats early without needing to wait to hit the 6-mana threshold like you have to with [r:R0048|Chemtech Duplicator].",
