    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "description": "A weak, combo-oriented champion that is somewhat difficult to set up and requires high mastery, with a playstyle revolving entirely around mana.\nJack's core gameplay relies on generating Coins and continuously refilling mana.\nWith [p:P0170|The Maker II], whenever you refill mana, you deal 1 damage to all enemy units. This provides solid AoE board clear and grants a +1|+0 buff to allies, synergizing perfectly with Attune units and Coin cards.\nHis weaknesses are very apparent: his board development is slow, and both his offense and defense are mediocre. Additionally, the 1 damage ping from his C3 is too insignificant against high-difficulty adventures with massive enemy stats, making Jack only viable for 4-Star content and below.\nJack's main combo loop: establish your board, trigger mana refills to ping the enemies and buff your units' attack, then swing at the Nexus.\nYou should prioritize Powers like [p:P0111|Sorcery], [p:P0113|Spellslinger], or [p:P0084|Wild Inspiration] to make executing his combos much easier.\nGood luck!",
        "descriptionRaw": "A weak, combo-oriented champion that is somewhat difficult to set up and requires high mastery, with a playstyle revolving entirely around mana.\\nJack's core gameplay relies on generating Coins and continuously refilling mana.\\nWith The Maker II, whenever you refill mana, you deal 1 damage to all enemy units. This provides solid AoE board clear and grants a +1|+0 buff to allies, synergizing perfectly with Attune units and Coin cards.\\nHis weaknesses are very apparent: his board development is slow, and both his offense and defense are mediocre. Additionally, the 1 damage ping from his C3 is too insignificant against high-difficulty adventures with massive enemy stats, making Jack only viable for 4-Star content and below.\\nJack's main combo loop: establish your board, trigger mana refills to ping the enemies and buff your units' attack, then swing at the Nexus.\\nYou should prioritize Powers like Sorcery, Spellslinger, or Wild Inspiration to make executing his combos much easier.\\nGood luck!",
        "name": "Jack",
        "optimalStars": "3 Stars",
        "playStyle": "Midrange // Combo",
        "ratings": {
          "playstyleNote": ""
        },
