    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "description": "A strong, fun champion featuring entertaining infinite card draw combos, with a playstyle that is not too difficult to pick up.\\n[cd:08PZ001|Janna] features a refined control playstyle revolving entirely around card draw and cost reduction mechanics. Her unique strength lies in the fact that playing cost-reduced cards further reduces the cost of cards you draw next, while drawing cards simultaneously buffs your board's attack stats.\\nAt her 3-Star (C3) power, [p:P0317|Blown Away II], 2 random cards in your hand get their cost reduced by 1, making it incredibly easy to chain infinite combos. This is the core engine that defines her entire playstyle.\\nHer C4 provides extra damage, while her 6-Star (C6) upgrade adds a Recall effect on an enemy unit whenever you attack with a Bird ally or your champion.\\nJanna's primary game plan: cast low-cost or 0-cost reduced spells early to trigger your cost reduction effects -> maintain board control and safely drop Janna -> spam cards with draw and cost reduction effects to level her up, swarm the board, and clear enemy blockers for an easy lethal swing.\\nAs a tip, prioritize Powers that draw extra cards each round, boost spell damage, or grant cost reduction to continuously fuel Janna's spell-slinging and card-cycling engine.",
        "descriptionRaw": "A strong, fun champion featuring entertaining infinite card draw combos, with a playstyle that is not too difficult to pick up.\\nJanna features a refined control playstyle revolving entirely around card draw and cost reduction mechanics. Her unique strength lies in the fact that playing cost-reduced cards further reduces the cost of cards you draw next, while drawing cards simultaneously buffs your board's attack stats.\\nAt her 3-Star (C3) power, Blown Away II, 2 random cards in your hand get their cost reduced by 1, making it incredibly easy to chain infinite combos. This is the core engine that defines her entire playstyle.\\nHer C4 provides extra damage, while her 6-Star (C6) upgrade adds a Recall effect on an enemy unit whenever you attack with a Bird ally or your champion.\\nJanna's primary game plan: cast low-cost or 0-cost reduced spells early to trigger your cost reduction effects -> maintain board control and safely drop Janna -> spam cards with draw and cost reduction effects to level her up, swarm the board, and clear enemy blockers for an easy lethal swing.\\nAs a tip, prioritize Powers that draw extra cards each round, boost spell damage, or grant cost reduction to continuously fuel Janna's spell-slinging and card-cycling engine.",
        "name": "Janna",
        "optimalStars": "4 Stars",
        "playStyle": "Control // Combo",
        "ratings": {
          "playstyleNote": ""
        },
        "regions": [
