    "supportChampions": [],
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "description": "An easy-to-play champion with a slow but steady control playstyle. He is very beginner-friendly, scales up to reliable damage, and blasting the enemy Nexus directly feels incredibly fun.\\n\\n[cd:05BC093|Veigar|icon,img-full] stands out with his stacking Darkness spells, granting him the ability to deal massive magic damage directly to the enemy Nexus once he levels up.\\n\\nKey cards in the deck: Otterpus helps you play defensively, refunds mana (Attune), and Pranks the enemy. Darkbulb Acolyte provides reliable Darkness generation. Pokey Stick offers good ping damage and card draw. Twisted Catalyzer ramps up your Darkness damage whenever it strikes. Lastly, Stress Defense provides powerful defensive capabilities, or it can be used offensively to shrink huge enemy units to a 1|6 statline so you can easily burst them down.\\n\\nRecommended Powers: Focus on drafting powers that either increase your spell damage or reduce your spell costs during your run.\\n\\n[cd:05BC093|Veigar|icon,img-full]'s Star Powers generate a 0-cost Darkness for you each round. More importantly, it upgrades your Darkness to [k:Burst|Burst] speed, allowing you to use it for sudden combat blowouts or to execute the opponent with absolutely zero chance for them to react or respond.",
        "descriptionRaw": "An easy-to-play champion with a slow but steady control playstyle. He is very beginner-friendly, scales up to reliable damage, and blasting the enemy Nexus directly feels incredibly fun.\\n\\nVeigar stands out with his stacking Darkness spells, granting him the ability to deal massive magic damage directly to the enemy Nexus once he levels up.\\n\\nKey cards in the deck: Otterpus helps you play defensively, refunds mana (Attune), and Pranks the enemy. Darkbulb Acolyte provides reliable Darkness generation. Pokey Stick offers good ping damage and card draw. Twisted Catalyzer ramps up your Darkness damage whenever it strikes. Lastly, Stress Defense provides powerful defensive capabilities, or it can be used offensively to shrink huge enemy units to a 1|6 statline so you can easily burst them down.\\n\\nRecommended Powers: Focus on drafting powers that either increase your spell damage or reduce your spell costs during your run.\\n\\nVeigar's Star Powers generate a 0-cost Darkness for you each round. More importantly, it upgrades your Darkness to Burst speed, allowing you to use it for sudden combat blowouts or to execute the opponent with absolutely zero chance for them to react or respond.",
        "name": "Veigar",
        "optimalStars": "4 Stars",
        "playStyle": "Control // Damaged spell",
        "regions": [
          "BandleCity",
          "ShadowIsles"
        ],
        "tags": [
          "DMG spell"
        ],
        "tier": "B Tier // Darkness playstyle"
      }
    }
  },
