        "recommendedStars": 4,
        "title": "Bộ 3",
        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "description": "The supreme build designed for 6 Star Yasuo. [r:R0061|Echoing Spirit] shuffles 7 champion copies into your deck and discounts champion spells to 1 mana, guaranteeing Yasuo in your opening hand. Combined with [r:R0103|Yasuo's Windblade] for bonus starting mana and [r:R0031|Tempest Blade] to obliterate the opposing board the moment he hits the battlefield.",
            "descriptionRaw": "The supreme build designed for 6 Star Yasuo. Echoing Spirit shuffles 7 champion copies into your deck and discounts champion spells to 1 mana, guaranteeing Yasuo in your opening hand. Combined with Yasuo's Windblade for bonus starting mana and Tempest Blade to obliterate the opposing board the moment he hits the battlefield.",
            "title": "Set 3"
