            "descriptionRaw": "Tailored for fast finishes. Voidborne Carapace allows Yasuo to inherit positive keywords whenever any unit dies, turning his passive board-clearing strikes and the Rally attack from Crownguard Inheritance into massive direct Nexus pressure after the Tempest Blade stun wave.",
